# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow: Gadgetzan -> boat to Powderfuse Port -> the Searing Gorge by its eastern pass (Caught!, Thorium
# Point, Kalaran Windblade, the Cauldron, the Slag Pit, the lookouts) -> fly to Kargath (Dreadmaul Rock,
# the Rise of the Machines) -> through Blackrock Mountain into the Burning Steppes (Flame Crest, Sha'ni
# Proudtusk, Krom'Grul, the Ruins of Thaurissan) -> fly to Kargath -> fly to Stonard (Fel'Zerul) ->
# the Blasted Lands bloodmages -> fly to Grom'gol (Grim Message) -> Booty Bay (Deliver to MacKinley,
# the OOX robots, the message in a bottle) -> Grom'gol -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar.
#
# Searing Gorge and Burning Steppes come together on one boat trip from Tanaris, after Feralas.

