step The Cauldron's slavers and golems
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Ride south from Thorium Point into the Cauldron: the Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves on the paths, and the Heavy War Golems patrol the floor below Kalaran.
