step Searing Gorge: kill these as you meet them
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Heavy War Golems patrol the Cauldron below Kalaran and drop the oil; the Magma and Blazing Elementals drifting among them drop the hearts. The Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves on the paths; a Slaver may drop the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep it.
  tip The Greater Lava Spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge.
  tip The Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. Incendosaurs swim in its lava pools: pull them to the edge. The secret plans lie on the pit's upper ledge.
  tip Careful: Dark Iron Slavers (level 45-46) call for help from allies within 15 yd when pulled, cast Net from up to 15 yd, and use Rend in melee.
  collect 11818 optional                -- Grimesilt Outhouse Key, a rare drop
  collect 10509 quest 3442.1
  collect 10511 quest 3442.2
  kill 5858 quest 7724.1
  kill 9318 quest 7727.1              -- Below ground

