step Serpent's Coil: kill these as you meet them
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip The five quests share the same parts: gather them all in one sweep. West of the road the Black Slayer vultures, Starving Snickerfangs, Scorpok Stingers and Deatheye basilisks share the hills.
  tip East of the road the Ashmane boars and Grunters root on the slopes beside the Redstone basilisks. Stay away from the level 52 Helboars further south.
  tip Careful: Scorpok Stingers use Venom Sting; Clack the Reaver adds Knockdown.
